{"case_id": "female_19800921_P007-Q34", "domain": "annual_fortune", "question": "命主的两名小孩在哪一年出生？", "expected_answer": "D", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主丁火生于酉月，金旺火弱，喜木火为用。命主在2013年（癸巳年）正值壬午大运（24-33岁），此运正官星透出，且流年癸巳七杀与日主丁火相合（癸丁合），地支巳酉丑三合金局，此年有婚恋或生育之象，但七杀为偏缘，可能为女孩。2015年（乙未年）在壬午大运中，乙木偏印生身，未土为食神，食神主女儿，且未中藏丁火，此年也利于生育女孩。而2017年（丁酉年）在辛巳大运，比肩透出，地支三合金局，金旺克木，不利子嗣，且丁火比肩为同性，可能为男孩但此年压力大，生育可能性较低。2020年（庚子年）在辛巳大运，正财透出，子水为七杀，但子酉相破，且丁火克庚金，此年生育可能性不高。综合来看，命主在2013年和2015年各生一个女孩的可能性最大，符合选项B。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "temporal_route_state": "ROUTED_WITH_TARGETS", "time_context_sha256": "4a49de998b4d726dbb713b85132e089b2e74d4992cdaf06b0cac47324471063c", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_time_on", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "female_19800921_P007-Q34", 1, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6d\\runs\\phase6-6d-v1-20260808-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_time_on_r1_g2\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 3782, "response_id": "ba8da604-e2ad-4d7a-8bc9-0cf6ef823903", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 533, "completion_tokens": 276, "total_tokens": 809, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 512}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 512, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 21}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
